              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "வற்று — vaṟṟu — \"to dry up; to ebb\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கோடையில் ஏரி வற்றியது. kōṭaiyil ēri vaṟṟiyatu. In summer the lake dried up."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): வற்றியது, vaṟṟiyatu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Of a river or a well; வறட்சி, a drought, is a close cousin."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "வற்று (vaṟṟu) is native Dravidian (DEDR 5320), \"to grow dry, to evaporate, to ebb\"."
            }
          ]
